    "created_at": "2018-02-27T19:53:59Z",
    "updated_at": "2018-02-27T19:53:59Z",
    "body": "My proposed resolution is to disallow constants on globals, as in general we shouldn't be using constants very much, and almost certainly not on the global object.\r\n\r\nWe could always revisit if someone has a compelling use case, but that's my instinct for now.",
